                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.001M26.</note>
                <head>[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico City</hi></placeName>. <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-11-06"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                        1911</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>On this date President Madero was inaugurated.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
